<title>NORWAY: Norway's Dyno Q3 pre-tax profit falls.</title>
<headline>Norway's Dyno Q3 pre-tax profit falls.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine months to September 30.</p>
<p>			     (millions of crowns unless stated)</p>
<p>Net operating income	 6,475	 vs	 7,599</p>
<p>Operating costs before</p>
<p>		 depreciation  5,810	 vs	 6,700</p>
<p>Operating result		 342	 vs	   538</p>
<p>Net financial items   minus   87	 vs  minus  123</p>
<p>Result before tax		275	 vs	   486</p>
<p>Result after tax		 164	 vs	   287</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of Norwegian explosives, chemicals and plastics group is Dyno Industrier ASA. A Reuter poll of six analysts forecast operating profits of 346 million crowns and a pre-tax result of 291 million crowns. Four of the analysts recommended a hold on Dyno while two say buy.</p>
<p>--Oslo newsroom, +47 22 42 50 41</p>
</text>
